# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import viewer/analytic_camera.dl

function check detail camera {boolean:passed} named {a string:label}:
    execute:
        if passed = false:
            print ((the string form of "FAIL ") + label) as a line
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "exit", nothing, 1)
        print label as a line

function the detail anchor of {analytic camera record:camera} at {a 64 bit floating-point number:x} {a 64 bit floating-point number:y} within {a 64 bit floating-point number:height}:
    execute:
        set across to (the analytic across of camera) scaled by (x * camera's span / height)
        set up to (the analytic up of camera) scaled by (0.0 - (y * camera's span / height))
        return the cad sum of camera's target and (the cad sum of across and up)

set camera to a new analytic camera
set across to the analytic across of camera
set up to the analytic up of camera
check detail camera ((the absolute value of (the cad dot of across and up)) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Screen axes are orthogonal")
set pan to the analytic camera camera panned by 120.0 and -60.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera ((the absolute value of ((the cad dot of pan's target and across) + 0.2)) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Horizontal pan follows the pointer")
check detail camera ((the absolute value of ((the cad dot of pan's target and up) + 0.1)) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Vertical pan follows the pointer")
set scaled to the analytic camera camera panned by 240.0 and -120.0 over height 1200.0
check detail camera ((the cad distance from scaled's target to pan's target) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Pan is invariant under display scaling")
set anchor to the detail anchor of pan at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0
set zoom to the analytic camera pan scrolled by 3.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera ((the cad distance from anchor to (the detail anchor of zoom at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0)) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Wheel zoom keeps the cursor anchor")
set scaled to the analytic camera pan scrolled by 3.0 at 300.0 -180.0 over height 1200.0
check detail camera ((the cad distance from scaled's target to zoom's target) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Zoom is invariant under display scaling")
set restored to the analytic camera zoom scrolled by -3.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera (((the cad distance from restored's target to pan's target) < 1e-12) and ((the absolute value of (restored's span - pan's span)) < 1e-12)) named (the string form of "Opposite wheel steps restore the camera")
set fractional to camera
loop tick from 0 to 4:
    set fractional to the analytic camera fractional scrolled by 0.25 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
set whole to the analytic camera camera scrolled by 1.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera (((the cad distance from fractional's target to whole's target) < 1e-12) and ((the absolute value of (fractional's span - whole's span)) < 1e-12)) named (the string form of "Fractional trackpad steps compose")
set near to the analytic camera camera scrolled by 40.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera ((near's span = 0.01) and ((the cad distance from (the detail anchor of camera at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0) to (the detail anchor of near at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0)) < 1e-12)) named (the string form of "Minimum span preserves the cursor anchor")
set blocked to the analytic camera near scrolled by 40.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera ((the cad distance from blocked's target to near's target) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Clamped zoom does not drift")
set far to the analytic camera camera scrolled by -40.0 at 150.0 -90.0 over height 600.0
check detail camera ((far's span = 100.0) and ((the cad distance from (the detail anchor of camera at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0) to (the detail anchor of far at 150.0 -90.0 within 600.0)) < 1e-12)) named (the string form of "Maximum span preserves the cursor anchor")
set unchanged to the analytic camera pan panned by 10.0 and 20.0 over height 0.0
set unchanged to the analytic camera unchanged scrolled by 1.0 at 10.0 20.0 over height 0.0
check detail camera ((unchanged's span = pan's span) and ((the cad distance from unchanged's target to pan's target) < 1e-12)) named (the string form of "Empty viewport leaves the camera unchanged")
set turned to the analytic camera zoom orbited by 10.0 and 20.0
check detail camera ((turned's yaw > zoom's yaw) and (turned's elevation > zoom's elevation)) named (the string form of "Orbit direction matches the regular camera")
check detail camera ((the cad distance from turned's target to zoom's target) < 1e-12) named (the string form of "Orbit retains the panned world target")
set clamped to the analytic camera turned orbited by 0.0 and 10000.0
check detail camera (clamped's elevation = 1.5) named (the string form of "Orbit stops before the pole")
set fitted to the fitted analytic camera turned
check detail camera (((fitted's span = 1.0) and ((the cad length of fitted's target) = 0.0)) and ((fitted's yaw = turned's yaw) and (fitted's elevation = turned's elevation))) named (the string form of "Fit resets framing and preserves orientation")
set held to the analytic drag 0 with buttons false true previously false false over body true enabled true
check detail camera (held = 2) named (the string form of "Middle press captures pan")
set held to the analytic drag held with buttons false true previously false true over body false enabled true
check detail camera (held = 2) named (the string form of "Dragging remains captured outside the viewport")
set held to the analytic drag held with buttons false false previously false true over body false enabled true
check detail camera (held = 0) named (the string form of "Release ends capture outside the viewport")
check detail camera ((the analytic drag 0 with buttons false true previously false true over body true enabled true) = 0) named (the string form of "Entering with a held button cannot capture")
check detail camera ((the analytic drag 0 with buttons true false previously false false over body true enabled true) = 1) named (the string form of "Right press captures orbit")
check detail camera ((the analytic drag 1 with buttons true false previously true false over body true enabled false) = 0) named (the string form of "Modal ownership cancels the gesture")
check detail camera ((the analytic drag 0 with buttons true false previously false false over body false enabled true) = 0) named (the string form of "Header and footer cannot start a gesture")
